damage_chance.description:
Specifies the percentage chance of this item losing durability. Default is set to 100. Defined as an int range with min and max value.

Properties:
• max (int) = 0
• min (int) = 0

Sample values:
• my_sword_chuck: {"min":10,"max":50}
• my_sword_singing: {"min":0,"max":0}
• my_sword_weak: {"min":100,"max":100}
